Ruled-out: Deleting the stale "unmeasured (#885)" sentence out of the three rationale strings entirely, instead of appending a superseding note | the sentence is a record of what was true on 2026-09-15, at a specific measurement; deleting it would make the string claim a narrower history than what actually happened.
Ruled-out: Lowering CITABLE_QUOTE_MIN so rule 15 sees `M` and `Name` | measured at 1: all six excepted files are refused for the word `note`, so the floor cannot be moved for this list without emptying it.
Ruled-out: Picking the row by value | 17 of 18 `Name` candidates share one spelling, so value alone cannot separate them, and for `Position` the three wrong rows differ only in Japanese. Choosing by value is how `trackTypeMaster` nearly took a Bass Amp label.
Ruled-out: Restoring a shrink-only ratchet on `exceptions` to compensate | it does not check the proposition that is actually granted, and it forbids the repair #937 is about. The co-reader's wording: repeated checking does not justify removing a ratchet, but the checked proposition has to match the permission -- so fix the claim, not the ratchet.
